		description: T("Extract document fields with Scan Agent at POST /v2/ocr/scan-gpt. image is required. validationMethod on the record is SCAN_AGENT.", "Extrae campos de un documento con Scan Agent en POST /v2/ocr/scan-gpt. image es obligatoria. validationMethod del registro es SCAN_AGENT.", "Extrayez les champs d'un document avec Scan Agent sur POST /v2/ocr/scan-gpt. image est obligatoire. validationMethod de l'enregistrement est SCAN_AGENT.", "Extraia campos de um documento com Scan Agent em POST /v2/ocr/scan-gpt. image é obrigatória. validationMethod do registro é SCAN_AGENT.", "POST /v2/ocr/scan-gpt의 Scan Agent로 문서 필드를 추출합니다. image는 필수입니다. 기록의 validationMethod는 SCAN_AGENT입니다.", "POST /v2/ocr/scan-gpt の Scan Agent で文書項目を抽出します。image は必須です。記録の validationMethod は SCAN_AGENT です。", "用 POST /v2/ocr/scan-gpt 的 Scan Agent 提取证件字段。image 必填。记录上的 validationMethod 是 SCAN_AGENT。"),
		intro: T("**Scan Agent** extracts structured fields from a document image. Call **POST** `https://api.verifik.co/v2/ocr/scan-gpt`. `image` is required. `documentType`, `backImage`, and `template` are optional. There is no `country` field on this body. The stored extraction sets `validationMethod` to `SCAN_AGENT`.", "**Scan Agent** extrae campos estructurados de la imagen de un documento. Llame **POST** `https://api.verifik.co/v2/ocr/scan-gpt`. `image` es obligatoria. `documentType`, `backImage` y `template` son opcionales. Este cuerpo no tiene un campo `country`. La extracción guardada pone `validationMethod` en `SCAN_AGENT`.", "**Scan Agent** extrait des champs structurés de l'image d'un document. Appelez **POST** `https://api.verifik.co/v2/ocr/scan-gpt`. `image` est obligatoire. `documentType`, `backImage` et `template` sont facultatifs. Ce corps n'a pas de champ `country`. L'extraction enregistrée met `validationMethod` à `SCAN_AGENT`.", "**Scan Agent** extrai campos estruturados da imagem de um documento. Chame **POST** `https://api.verifik.co/v2/ocr/scan-gpt`. `image` é obrigatória. `documentType`, `backImage` e `template` são opcionais. Este corpo não tem um campo `country`. A extração gravada põe `validationMethod` em `SCAN_AGENT`.", "**Scan Agent**는 문서 이미지에서 구조화 필드를 추출합니다. **POST** `https://api.verifik.co/v2/ocr/scan-gpt`를 호출합니다. `image`는 필수입니다. `documentType`, `backImage`, `template`은 선택입니다. 이 본문에는 `country` 필드가 없습니다. 저장된 추출은 `validationMethod`를 `SCAN_AGENT`로 둡니다.", "**Scan Agent** は文書画像から構造化項目を抽出します。**POST** `https://api.verifik.co/v2/ocr/scan-gpt` を呼びます。`image` は必須です。`documentType`、`backImage`、`template` は任意です。この本文に `country` 項目はありません。保存された抽出は `validationMethod` を `SCAN_AGENT` にします。", "**Scan Agent** 从证件图像提取结构化字段。调用 **POST** `https://api.verifik.co/v2/ocr/scan-gpt`。`image` 必填。`documentType`、`backImage` 和 `template` 可选。此正文没有 `country` 字段。保存的提取把 `validationMethod` 设为 `SCAN_AGENT`。"),
